ADDENDUM <Presidential Decree No. 17824, Dec. 30, 2002>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on January 1, 2003; provided, the provisions to subparagraph 2 and 3 of Article 4 shall enter into force on January 1, 2004.
Article 2 (Repeal of other statutes or regulations)
The following Presidential Decrees shall be hereby repealed:
